f 0 GHz 1000 GHz 1 GHz
output f GHz  Tb K
za 30 deg
tol 1e-4

Nscale troposphere iwp_abs_Rayleigh 10

T0 2.7 K

layer stratosphere
Pbase 70 mbar
Tbase 213.0 K
column iwp_abs_Rayleigh 1 kg*m^-2

layer troposphere
Pbase 500 mbar
Tbase 255.7 K
lineshape Voigt-Kielkopf
column iwp_abs_Rayleigh 2 kg*m^-2

layer troposphere
Pbase 600 mbar
Tbase 275.7 K
lineshape Voigt-Kielkopf
column iwp_abs_Rayleigh 4 kg*m^-2


